        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>At the heart of the Teton Valley Foundation is the mission of &#8220;making the good life better,&#8221; and for the last fifteen years, The Community Foundation has helped us keep that promise to make a good life even better.<br><br>Teton Valley&#8217;s favorite night out, Music on Main, sees 2500-3000 attendees at each concert from all ages and backgrounds. The Kotler Ice Arena serves youth and adult recreationists and competitive athletes with 1500 ice enthusiasts at the rink each week. <br><br>CFTV and the Tin Cup Challenge have helped TVF sustain these programs, and the support has expanded our ice facility and music programming. The impact of this financial support from Tin Cup Challengers and individual donors is immeasurable.<br><br>From fence panels to musicians, from helmets to Zamboni blades, the donations from the Tin Cup Challenge have created opportunities in Teton Valley for affordable play, positive connections, and the chance to make everlasting memories for the whole community year round.</p>
